seg-9a8c218ce054 = Integrity and security: what Kshana models, and what it does not

# text
seg-52038c93765d = Kshana reports two figures of merit (FoMs) — <b>Integrity</b> and <b>Security</b> — that are easy to mistake for the aviation-grade quantities of the same name. This page states plainly what they are today, what they are <em>not</em>, and what the roadmap adds. If you are evaluating Kshana for a safety-of-life or certification context, read this first.

